{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": {
    "text": "职业一览",
    "color": "aqua",
    "bold": true
  },
  "external_title": {
    "text": "职业一览"
  },
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "只有站上准备台（大厅里高亮的位置）才会收到职业面板，点文字即可选择。",
        "color": "gray"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "职业只在一局内有效：回合结束会被清空，下一局重新选。",
        "color": "gray"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": " "
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "【旋风人】",
        "color": "aqua",
        "bold": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "开局发放 2 个风弹。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "天生就是生产风弹的，可是我要那么多风弹干啥呢？",
        "color": "dark_gray"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": " "
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "【炸弹人】",
        "color": "red",
        "bold": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "开局发放 2 个抛射型tnt。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "先给你一个炸弹，你又能炸死谁呢？",
        "color": "dark_gray"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": " "
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "【无影】",
        "color": "light_purple",
        "bold": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "开局发放 2 支传送箭。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "你就喜欢传送，问题是飞那么远真的不疼吗...",
        "color": "dark_gray"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": " "
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "width": 300,
      "contents": {
        "text": "没选职业也可以正常开局，只是不会额外拿到职业道具。",
        "color": "gray"
      }
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "text": "← 返回主菜单"
    },
    "width": 150,
    "action": {
      "type": "show_dialog",
      "dialog": "tkot:guide_main"
    }
  }
}
